      "number": 18,
      "pali": "Aniccaññeva, bhikkhave, bhikkhu viññāṇaṁ aniccanti passati. Sāssa hoti sammādiṭṭhi. ",
      "english": "Consciousness really is impermanent. A mendicant sees that it is impermanent: that’s their right view. "
